  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<p>Correct answer: A</p>\n<p>A: From the diagram: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{n=2}=-330\\,\\text{kJ mol}^{-1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{n=4}=-80\\,\\text{kJ mol}^{-1}\"></span>. For absorption, photon energy <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta E=E_{n=4}-E_{n=2}=(-80)-(-330)=+250\\,\\text{kJ mol}^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>B: 80 kJ mol<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> is the magnitude of the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=4\"></span> level relative to zero, not the energy difference between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=4\"></span>.</p>\n<p>C: 410 kJ mol<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> corresponds to the difference between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=\\infty\"></span>: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0-(-330)=330\\,\\text{kJ mol}^{-1}\"></span>, not 410; the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=4\"></span> gap is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"250\\,\\text{kJ mol}^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>D: 330 kJ mol<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> is the energy required to ionize from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=\\infty\"></span>: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0-(-330)=330\\,\\text{kJ mol}^{-1}\"></span>, not the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=4\"></span> transition.</p>"
  },
  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows the energy levels of an atom. All values are given in kJ mol&lt;sup&gt;-1&lt;/sup&gt;.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the energy (in kJ mol&lt;sup&gt;-1&lt;/sup&gt;) of the photon absorbed when an electron transitions from the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span> to the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=4\"></span> level?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">250 kJ mol<sup>-1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">80 kJ mol<sup>-1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">410 kJ mol<sup>-1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">330 kJ mol<sup>-1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
